        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG111, Contemporary Stainless Steel LA Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe LA Stainless Steel Lever features a contemporary shape that has a pleasing aesthetic that flows. It is made out of stainless steel for a modern end look that is as durable as it is beautiful. The Stainless Steel LA Lever is available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and is adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions for interior doors in residential or commercial settings.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-111-specifications.gif?v=1704354646\" width=\"453\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG111 Lever Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the AHI SIG111 Contemporary Stainless Steel Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For residential or commercial applications</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors)</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Premium latch requires only 28° rotation to retract latchbolt</li>\r\n<li>Meets standards of the <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the SIG111 Contemporary Stainless Steel Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-4/8\" (140 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\" (60 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Width: 0.31\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/16\" (62 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-111-specifications.pdf?v=1691093352\"><b>AHI SIG111 Lever Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a door pull or to match trim. Trim is on one side of door. Lever is surface mounted (mounting plate screws to the doors face).</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. For use with a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole pre-drilled door. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "LA Stainless Steel Lever",
                "description": "The LA Stainless Steel Lever features a contemporary shape that has a pleasing aesthetic that flows. It is made out of stainless steel for a modern end look that is as durable as it is beautiful. The Stainless Steel LA Lever is available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and is adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions for interior doors in residential or commercial settings.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Los Angeles Stainless Steel Levers, AHI SIG111, AHI SIG111 Hollow Levers, AHI-SIG111, AHI SIG111 Stainless Steel Leversets, Modern Stainless Steel Los Angeles Levers, modern levers, contemporary levers, SIG111 Modern Stainless Steel Leversets, LA Stainless Steel Levers,"
